[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891667\">3380A44</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Handbrake switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890494\">I40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt.</p><p>3. Remove the switch.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035461.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the switch is not\ndamaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical test on it.</p><p>Refit the switch fixing it using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Check the operation of the handbrake warning\nlight.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891667\">3380A44</a></p>"]]